{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23585","headline":"病中多雨逢寒食 · 白居易","name":"病中多雨逢寒食","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水国多阴常嬾出，老夫饶病爱闲眠。\n三旬卧度莺花月，一半春销风雨天。\n薄暮何人吹觱篥，新晴几处缚秋千。\n彩绳芳树长如旧，唯是年年换少年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}